⚠️ IMPORTANT LEGAL NOTICE ⚠️

This software is intended for EDUCATIONAL and LEGITIMATE purposes ONLY.

LEGITIMATE USE CASES:
- Recovering YOUR OWN lost cryptocurrency wallet passphrases
- Security research on brain wallet vulnerabilities
- Educational purposes to understand cryptographic key derivation

ILLEGAL USE CASES (STRICTLY PROHIBITED):
- Attempting to access cryptocurrency wallets you do not own
- Stealing funds from other people's wallets
- Any unauthorized access to cryptocurrency addresses

WARNING:
Using this software to access wallets without explicit ownership authorization 
is ILLEGAL and constitutes THEFT under criminal law in most jurisdictions. 
Violators may face severe legal consequences including imprisonment and fines.

The authors and contributors of this software are NOT responsible for any 
misuse or illegal activities conducted using this tool. Users are solely 
responsible for ensuring their use complies with all applicable laws.

By using this software, you acknowledge that:
1. You will only use it on wallets YOU OWN
2. You understand the legal implications of unauthorized access
3. You accept full responsibility for your actions
